@*  INJ-008 Andon user manual. *@

<div class="help-doc">
    <div>
        <div class="help-h1">INJ-008 · ANDON 🚨</div>
        <div class="help-sub">긴급 호출 — 라인 정지/품질/자재/안전 사유 선택 후 발신</div>

        <svg class="help-svg" viewBox="0 0 720 480" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect x="6" y="6" width="708" height="468" rx="10" fill="#000" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.18)" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <rect class="hs-region tbar" x="14" y="14" width="692" height="42" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="34" y="40">INJ-008 · STATION · LINE  ·  ANDON</text>

            @* ① Call types 2x2 *@
            <rect class="hs-region" x="14" y="68" width="692" height="244" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="88">▼ CALL TYPE  ·  4 cards</text>
            @{
                var names = new[] { "MACHINE STOP","QUALITY","MATERIAL","SAFETY" };
                var cls = new[] { "bad","warn","ok","bad" };
            }
            @for (var i = 0; i < 4; i++)
            {
                var col = i % 2; var row = i / 2;
                var x = 28 + col * 340; var y = 104 + row * 104;
                <g>
                    <rect class="hs-region @cls[i]" x="@x" y="@y" width="324" height="92" />
                    <text class="hs-label" x="@(x+162)" y="@(y+56)" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:20px;">@names[i]</text>
                </g>
            }
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="78" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="78">1</text>

            @* ② Recent calls log *@
            <rect class="hs-region" x="14" y="326" width="692" height="100" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="346">▼ RECENT CALLS  ·  최근 5건</text>
            @for (var i = 0; i < 3; i++)
            {
                var y = 358 + i * 22;
                <g>
                    <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="@y" fill="#fca5a5">@(15-i):0@(i)  ·  @(new[]{"MACHINE","QUALITY","MATERIAL"}[i])</text>
                    <text class="hs-sub" x="676" y="@y" text-anchor="end">@(new[]{"ACK 2 min","RESOLVED 5 min","ACK 8 min"}[i])</text>
                </g>
            }
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="336" r="13" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="336">2</text>

            <rect class="hs-region nav" x="14" y="432" width="692" height="32" />
        </svg>
    </div>

    <div>
        <div class="help-section-h">▶ <span class="h-sec-en">READ THE SCREEN</span><span class="h-sec-ko">화면 읽기</span></div>
        <div class="help-steps">
            <div class="help-step bad">
                <div class="help-step-num">1</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">4 large call cards. Single tap = call dispatched (with confirm prompt).</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">4개 큰 호출 카드. 1탭으로 발신 (확인 팝업 1단계).</div>
                    <div class="help-step-hint">MACHINE STOP / SAFETY → red (highest)</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-step dim">
                <div class="help-step-num">2</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">Recent call log. ACK = supervisor acknowledged. RESOLVED = fixed.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">최근 호출 이력. ACK = 반장 응답, RESOLVED = 해결.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-callout">
            <div class="help-callout-i">🚨</div>
            <div class="help-callout-tx">
                <span class="h-call-en"><strong>Use carefully.</strong> Andon notifies the supervisor's mobile, the floor display, and SAP for serious cases. False calls degrade response speed.</span><span class="h-call-ko">반장 모바일 · 라인 표시기 · SAP 알림 발생. 오발신 주의.</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
